<title>UK: Both Brent dates kept voluntarily on Tues - trade.</title>
<headline>Both Brent dates kept voluntarily on Tues - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both Brent cargoes nominated loading dates on Tuesday were kept voluntarily ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>BP and Stasco kept the October 16-18 cargoes.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
